MMLongBench-Doc-V2

Derived from MMLongBench-Doc (https://github.com/mayubo2333/MMLongBench-Doc),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Relationship to the upstream release:

  data/samples.json
      1,081 questions, unchanged from upstream except for 106 corrected
      annotations and one duplicate row removed. Every change is
      documented in data/corrections/.

  data/question_types.json
      New in V2. Model-produced labels (task_type, requires_visual); not
      human-verified and not part of the ground truth.

  data/corrections/
      New in V2. data/corrections/samples_v1.json is upstream's
      original samples.json, redistributed unmodified for diffing.

  eval/
      Entirely new in V2. Upstream's scoring pipeline -- eval_score.py,
      extract_answer.py and prompt_for_answer_extraction.md -- is NOT
      included; V2 scores with an LLM judge instead. No upstream source
      code is redistributed here.
